{"4188690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cats to the Moon", "steam_appid": 4188690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small step for a cat, a giant leap for feline-kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats to the Moon</strong> is a short, quirky incremental game where you guide a nation of silly cats as they strive to become the first to land on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your tiny village into a thriving nation as your buildings passively generate resources such as wood, stone, and gold. Each resource helps you unlock new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, laboratories, observatories, and much more on your way to scientific progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve gathered enough resources, build the ultimate rocket and prepare for a historic lunar landing!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small step for a cat, a giant leap for feline-kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats to the Moon</strong> is a short, quirky incremental game where you guide a nation of silly cats as they strive to become the first to land on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your tiny village into a thriving nation as your buildings passively generate resources such as wood, stone, and gold. Each resource helps you unlock new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, laboratories, observatories, and much more on your way to scientific progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve gathered enough resources, build the ultimate rocket and prepare for a historic lunar landing!</p>", "short_description": "Cats to the Moon is a short incremental game about leading a nation of silly cats as they attempt to become the first ever to land on the moon. Explore space, build your city, and most importantly, reach a place no other cat has ever been.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</